   "output": "You are comparing two drafts written from the same brief. Read no other file, and do not run commands or browse; judge only the text below.\n\nBrief: Write the landing page copy for `sackview`, following the tool page section order.\n\n<<<DRAFT A\n# See inside a ZIP before you unpack it\n\nsackview shows what is inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. It displays the total unpacked size so you can check available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\nInstall sackview:\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\nEach entry shows its name, compressed size, and unpacked size.\n\n## Inspect an archive\n\nList the entries in `photos.zip`:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\n## Commands\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShow only entries whose names match `*.csv`:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Good to know\n\n### Archive safety\n\nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive.\n\n### Privacy\n\nInspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n### Supported formats\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message and return exit code 24.\nDRAFT A>>>\n\n<<<DRAFT B\n# sackview\n\nSee what\u2019s inside a ZIP archive before you unpack it. sackview lists each entry\u2019s name, compressed size, and unpacked size, along with the total unpacked size so you can check available disk space before extracting elsewhere.\n\n## Install\n\n```sh\npipx install sackview\n```\n\n## Inspect an archive\n\nList the archive\u2019s entries:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip\n```\n\nShow the ten entries with the largest unpacked sizes, largest first:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --largest 10\n```\n\nShow only entries whose names match a pattern:\n\n```sh\nsackview inspect photos.zip --find '*.csv'\n```\n\n## Inspect without changing the archive\n\nsackview never extracts entries or changes the archive. Inspection works offline and sends no archive contents to a service.\n\n## Supported formats\n\nsackview supports ZIP archives only. Other archive formats produce an unsupported-format message.\nDRAFT B>>>\n\nAnswer each question with \"A\", \"B\", or \"SAME\":\n- \"reader\": Could a first-time reader do what they came to do?\n- \"careful\": Does it read like a careful person wrote it?\n- \"overall\": Which draft is better overall?\n\nReply with only JSON: {\"reader\": \"A\", \"careful\": \"A\", \"overall\": \"A\", \"reason\": \"<one sentence>\"}",
